SUMMARY:TY FREEMAN (UK) / THE MUDDY MOON (Uhrzeit prüfen)
LOCATION:Chelsea
DESCRIPTION:Doors: 19:30h\, Start: 20:00   TY FREEMAN is a British artist from the Wirral\, Merseyside\, with his band and creative base spanning Liverpool and Zurich. His music sits at the intersection of raw soul\, guitar-driven rock\, and emotional confrontation — built on instinct\, physical groove\, and the belief that great rock music should do something to the room. Rather than leaning on revivalism or nostalgia\, Ty’s sound is rooted in urgency\, tension\, and release\, shaped for live impact above all else. On stage\, Ty Freeman and his band deliver performances that are direct\, immersive and unguarded. Songs are allowed to stretch\, bruise and breathe. Driven by commanding vocals\, visceral guitars and a band that plays with intent. The result is a live show that feels dangerous\, intimate and powerful\, pulling audiences in quickly and holding them there. This is modern rock music with weight and conviction. Built for stages where presence\, energy\, and connection still matter. www.tyfreemanmusic.com/    THE MUDDY MOON – ist Patrick „Laschi“ Laschober (Gitarre\, Gesang)\, Dominik „Staffa“ Staffa (Schlagzeug)\, Manuel „Tyson“ Bauer (Bass) und Daniel „Jimmy“ Radosztics (Gitarre\, Mundharmonika). The Muddy Moon zelebrieren erdigen Rock ´n´ Roll und Blues\, wie ihn der Teufel in seinem eigenen Beisl abspielen würde. 4 hearts filled with Rock’n’Roll.. ergibt eine musikalische Vielfalt die man so auch in den tiefen Sumpflandschaften finden würde. www.themuddymoon.com www.instagram.com/themuddymoon www.facebook.com/.../The-Muddy-Moon/100094632537078/    Tickets: www.eventbrite.de/e/ty-freeman-the-muddy-moon-tickets-2002784096145?aff=oddtdtcreato
URL:https://www.chelsea.co.at/concerts.php#concert_6718
